{"seq":1,"slug":"single-qubit-gates","title":"单 qubit 门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-and-circuits/single-qubit-gates","wordCount":1229,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"单-qubit-门\">单 qubit 门</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单 qubit 门是 2×2 unitary 矩阵——把一个 qubit 状态变换为另一状态。最重要的单 qubit 门——X / Y / Z（Pauli 三剑客）、H（Hadamard 创造 superposition）、S（√Z）、T（√S，与 H 一起 universal）、Rx / Ry / Rz（参数化旋转）。任意单 qubit unitary 可用 H + T 任意精度近似（Solovay-Kitaev 定理 polylog 复杂度）。所有单 qubit 门必须 unitary（U†U = I）保证可逆与 normalization preservation。本节给出每个门的矩阵表示、对常见 basis 状态的作用、Bloch sphere 旋转直观、组合规则、与经典门的对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>门</th>\n<th>矩阵</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>Bloch 旋转</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>[[1,0],[0,1]]</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>不动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>[[0,1],[1,0]]</td>\n<td>翻转 |0⟩↔|1⟩</td>\n<td>x 轴 180°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>[[0,-i],[i,0]]</td>\n<td>翻转 + 相位</td>\n<td>y 轴 180°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Z</td>\n<td>[[1,0],[0,-1]]</td>\n<td>|1⟩→-|1⟩</td>\n<td>z 轴 180°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>(1/√2)[[1,1],[1,-1]]</td>\n<td>创造 superposition</td>\n<td>(x+z)/√2 轴 180°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S</td>\n<td>[[1,0],[0,i]]</td>\n<td>√Z</td>\n<td>z 轴 90°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>[[1,0],[0,e^(iπ/4)]]</td>\n<td>√S</td>\n<td>z 轴 45°</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pauli-gates\">Pauli Gates</h2><p><strong>Pauli X</strong>（Quantum NOT）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"X = ⎡0 1⎤&#10;    ⎣1 0⎦&#10;&#10;X|0⟩ = |1⟩&#10;X|1⟩ = |0⟩&#10;X|+⟩ = |+⟩  (|+⟩ 是 X eigenstate)&#10;X|-⟩ = -|-⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>X = ⎡0 1⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ⎣1 0⎦</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X|0⟩ = |1⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X|1⟩ = |0⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X|+⟩ = |+⟩  (|+⟩ 是 X eigenstate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X|-⟩ = -|-⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Pauli Y</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Y = ⎡0 -i⎤&#10;    ⎣i  0⎦&#10;&#10;Y|0⟩ = i|1⟩&#10;Y|1⟩ = -i|0⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Y = ⎡0 -i⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ⎣i  0⎦</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Y|0⟩ = i|1⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Y|1⟩ = -i|0⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Pauli Z</strong>（Phase flip）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Z = ⎡1  0⎤&#10;    ⎣0 -1⎦&#10;&#10;Z|0⟩ = |0⟩&#10;Z|1⟩ = -|1⟩&#10;Z|+⟩ = |-⟩&#10;Z|-⟩ = |+⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Z = ⎡1  0⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ⎣0 -1⎦</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Z|0⟩ = |0⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Z|1⟩ = -|1⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Z|+⟩ = |-⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Z|-⟩ = |+⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>性质</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>X² = Y² = Z² = I（自逆）。</li>\n<li>XY = iZ，YZ = iX，ZX = iY（cyclic）。</li>\n<li>{X, Y, Z, I} 构成单 qubit 算子的 basis。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"hadamard-gate\">Hadamard Gate</h2><p><strong>H 是量子计算最重要的门</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"H = (1/√2) ⎡1  1⎤&#10;           ⎣1 -1⎦\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>H = (1/√2) ⎡1  1⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           ⎣1 -1⎦</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>作用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>H|0⟩ = (|0⟩ + |1⟩) / √2 = |+⟩</li>\n<li>H|1⟩ = (|0⟩ - |1⟩) / √2 = |-⟩</li>\n<li>H|+⟩ = |0⟩</li>\n<li>H|-⟩ = |1⟩</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>意义</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>把 computational basis 转 X basis（vice versa）。</li>\n<li>创造 equal superposition（关键资源）。</li>\n<li>自逆：H² = I。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tensor product H⊗N</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>把 N qubit |0⟩^N 变成 (1/√(2^N)) Σ_x |x⟩——所有 2^N basis state equal superposition。</li>\n<li>这是大多数量子算法第一步。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"phase-gates\">Phase Gates</h2><p><strong>S 门</strong>（Phase gate, √Z）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"S = ⎡1 0⎤&#10;    ⎣0 i⎦&#10;&#10;S² = Z。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>S = ⎡1 0⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ⎣0 i⎦</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S² = Z。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>T 门</strong>（π/8 gate, √S）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"T = ⎡1   0    ⎤&#10;    ⎣0 e^(iπ/4)⎦&#10;&#10;T² = S, T⁴ = Z。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>T = ⎡1   0    ⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ⎣0 e^(iπ/4)⎦</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T² = S, T⁴ = Z。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>重要</strong>：H + T 是 universal—— Solovay-Kitaev 定理给任意单 qubit unitary 用 H+T sequence 近似的多项式（polylog 1/ε）算法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[单 qubit Universal Set] --&gt; B[H + T]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Solovay-Kitaev]&#10;    C --&gt; D[任意 U 用 H,T sequence 近似]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Length O log d 1/eps c]&#10;    E --&gt; F[c 约 3.97 在 H+T basis]\">graph TD\n    A[单 qubit Universal Set] --&gt; B[H + T]\n    A --&gt; C[Solovay-Kitaev]\n    C --&gt; D[任意 U 用 H,T sequence 近似]\n    D --&gt; E[Length O log d 1/eps c]\n    E --&gt; F[c 约 3.97 在 H+T basis]</pre><h2 id=\"rotation-gates\">Rotation Gates</h2><p>参数化旋转：</p>\n<p><strong>Rx(θ)</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Rx(θ) = ⎡cos(θ/2)    -i sin(θ/2)⎤&#10;        ⎣-i sin(θ/2)  cos(θ/2)  ⎦\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Rx(θ) = ⎡cos(θ/2)    -i sin(θ/2)⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ⎣-i sin(θ/2)  cos(θ/2)  ⎦</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Ry(θ)</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Ry(θ) = ⎡cos(θ/2)  -sin(θ/2)⎤&#10;        ⎣sin(θ/2)   cos(θ/2)⎦\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Ry(θ) = ⎡cos(θ/2)  -sin(θ/2)⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ⎣sin(θ/2)   cos(θ/2)⎦</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Rz(θ)</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Rz(θ) = ⎡e^(-iθ/2)    0     ⎤&#10;        ⎣0         e^(iθ/2) ⎦\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Rz(θ) = ⎡e^(-iθ/2)    0     ⎤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ⎣0         e^(iθ/2) ⎦</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关系</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rx(π) = -iX</li>\n<li>Ry(π) = -iY</li>\n<li>Rz(π) = -iZ</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Phase 不影响测量</strong> → 实战可忽略 global phase。</p>\n<p><strong>Universal continuous</strong>：任意单 qubit unitary 可写成 Rz(α) Ry(β) Rz(γ)（Euler decomposition）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单-qubit-门组合\">单 qubit 门组合</h2><p><strong>Gate 序列</strong>：从右到左 apply。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"|ψ_out⟩ = U_n ... U_2 U_1 |ψ_in⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>|ψ_out⟩ = U_n ... U_2 U_1 |ψ_in⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>矩阵乘法对应</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多个门 = 矩阵相乘。</li>\n<li>HZ = ?: Hadamard then Z = (1/√2)[[1,-1],[1,1]]。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>例：从 |0⟩ 制备 |+⟩</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"H|0⟩ = |+⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>H|0⟩ = |+⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>例：从 |0⟩ 制备 |i⟩</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"SH|0⟩ = S|+⟩ = (|0⟩ + i|1⟩)/√2 = |i⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>SH|0⟩ = S|+⟩ = (|0⟩ + i|1⟩)/√2 = |i⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>例：从 |+⟩ 到 |1⟩</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"H |+⟩ = |0⟩&#10;X |0⟩ = |1⟩&#10;即 XH |+⟩ = |1⟩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>H |+⟩ = |0⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X |0⟩ = |1⟩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>即 XH |+⟩ = |1⟩</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"单-qubit-门的物理实现\">单 qubit 门的物理实现</h2><p><strong>超导 qubit</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>微波脉冲驱动跃迁。</li>\n<li>长度 ns-100ns。</li>\n<li>Fidelity 99.9%+。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Trapped ion</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Laser 驱动跃迁。</li>\n<li>长度 μs。</li>\n<li>Fidelity 99.99%+（最佳）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>任意单 qubit 旋转</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>调 microwave / laser 频率、幅度、相位、duration。</li>\n<li>直接实现 Rx / Ry / Rz / 任意 U(2)。</li>\n<li>不需 gate decomposition。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"universal-gate-set\">Universal Gate Set</h2><p><strong>Discrete universal</strong>：H + T + CNOT。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>任意 unitary 可用此集合任意精度近似。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Continuous universal</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>任意单 qubit U + CNOT。</li>\n<li>实战物理实现（直接 microwave 控制）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>为什么需要 universal</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>编程 abstraction——只用几个门就能表达任意 quantum algorithm。</li>\n<li>Compilation——把 high-level circuit decompose 到硬件原生 gate set。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pauli-algebra\">Pauli Algebra</h2><p><strong>重要 commutator / anti-commutator</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>{X, Y} = XY + YX = 0（anti-commute）。</li>\n<li>[X, Y] = XY - YX = 2iZ。</li>\n<li>同样 cyclic for (Y, Z) → 2iX, (Z, X) → 2iY。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>应用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pauli string M = X⊗Y⊗I⊗Z⊗... 是多 qubit observable。</li>\n<li>VQE / QAOA 算法用 Pauli string 表示 Hamiltonian。</li>\n<li>Quantum chemistry simulation 中关键。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战-qiskit\">实战 Qiskit</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from qiskit import QuantumCircuit&#10;from qiskit.quantum_info import Statevector&#10;&#10;qc = QuantumCircuit(1)&#10;&#10;# 应用 H&#10;qc.h(0)&#10;state = Statevector.from_instruction(qc)&#10;print(state)  # [0.707+0j, 0.707+0j] = |+&gt;&#10;&#10;# Rx(pi/4)&#10;qc.rx(3.14159/4, 0)&#10;&#10;# T&#10;qc.t(0)&#10;&#10;# 完整 universal set 可用：rx, ry, rz, x, y, z, h, s, t, sdg, tdg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qiskit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> QuantumCircuit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qiskit.quantum_info </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Statevector</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">qc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> QuantumCircuit(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 应用 H</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">qc.h(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Statevector.from_instruction(qc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># [0.707+0j, 0.707+0j] = |+></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Rx(pi/4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">qc.rx(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.14159</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">qc.t(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 完整 universal set 可用：rx, ry, rz, x, y, z, h, s, t, sdg, tdg</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"测量门\">测量门</h2><p>虽然不是 unitary，但常被画在电路中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"─U─U─Measure─\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>─U─U─Measure─</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Mid-circuit measurement</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>现代 quantum computer 支持中途测量 + classical feed-forward。</li>\n<li>用于 QEC、teleportation。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"单-qubit-门的常见误解\">单 qubit 门的常见误解</h2><p><strong>误解 1：X 门是 NOT</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>部分对——经典 sense 下是 NOT。</li>\n<li>但 X|+⟩ = |+⟩——X 在 X basis 中不是 NOT。</li>\n<li>取决于 basis。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>误解 2：H 是&quot;复制&quot;门</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>错。H 创造 superposition，不复制。</li>\n<li>No-cloning theorem 禁止任意 unknown qubit 复制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>误解 3：所有 single qubit unitary 等价</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>错。具体 angle 与 axis 决定计算能力。</li>\n<li>T 门是关键——只有 H + S 不 universal（Clifford gates 经典模拟容易）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>误解 4：S² = T</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>错。S² = Z，T² = S。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与经典门对比\">与经典门对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>经典门</th>\n<th>量子等价 / 推广</th>\n<th>可逆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NOT</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AND</td>\n<td>Toffoli (CCX)</td>\n<td>用 ancilla</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OR</td>\n<td>NAND + Toffoli</td>\n<td>用 ancilla</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COPY</td>\n<td>CNOT</td>\n<td>仅经典 input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ERASE</td>\n<td>不存在</td>\n<td>必须用 measurement</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>经典门可不可逆（AND 把 2 bit 变 1 bit 丢信息）。</li>\n<li>量子门必须 unitary（可逆）。</li>\n<li>用 ancilla qubit 让经典门成 reversible（Toffoli, Fredkin 是 universal classical reversible）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>单 qubit 门是 2×2 unitary——X / Y / Z（Pauli，自逆）、H（Hadamard 创造 superposition，自逆）、S（√Z）、T（√S，与 H universal）、Rx / Ry / Rz（参数化旋转）。Pauli 性质——X² = Y² = Z² = I, XY = iZ cyclic, anti-commute。H 把 computational basis ↔ X basis，H⊗N|0⟩^N 是所有 2^N basis state equal superposition（多算法第一步）。S = √Z, T = √S, T² = S, T⁴ = Z。Solovay-Kitaev 定理——H + T 用 polylog 长度近似任意单 qubit U。Rotation gates Rx/Ry/Rz 给参数化连续旋转，Euler decomposition U = Rz Ry Rz。Gate 序列从右到左 apply（矩阵乘法），HZ ≠ ZH（不交换）。物理实现——超导 microwave ns-100ns、trapped ion laser μs。Universal set——discrete H+T+CNOT 或 continuous 单 qubit U + CNOT。Pauli algebra anti-commutator 关键于 VQE / QAOA。Qiskit gate API（rx, ry, rz, h, s, t...）。Mid-circuit measurement 用于 QEC / teleportation。常见误解——X 不是所有 basis 的 NOT、H 不是 cloning、并非所有单 qubit gate equivalent（T 关键）、S²=Z 不是 T。与经典门对比——量子必须 unitary 可逆，用 ancilla 让经典门 reversible（Toffoli universal classical reversible）。一个简单的检验：你能解释为什么&quot;H + S（无 T）不是 universal&quot;？如果不能，Clifford vs non-Clifford 区别还需巩固。单 qubit 门是量子电路的&quot;原子操作&quot;——理解它们 + Bloch sphere 几何让单 qubit 编程变直观。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"单 qubit 门","id":"单-qubit-门"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Pauli Gates","id":"pauli-gates"},{"level":2,"text":"Hadamard Gate","id":"hadamard-gate"},{"level":2,"text":"Phase Gates","id":"phase-gates"},{"level":2,"text":"Rotation Gates","id":"rotation-gates"},{"level":2,"text":"单 qubit 门组合","id":"单-qubit-门组合"},{"level":2,"text":"单 qubit 门的物理实现","id":"单-qubit-门的物理实现"},{"level":2,"text":"Universal Gate Set","id":"universal-gate-set"},{"level":2,"text":"Pauli Algebra","id":"pauli-algebra"},{"level":2,"text":"实战 Qiskit","id":"实战-qiskit"},{"level":2,"text":"测量门","id":"测量门"},{"level":2,"text":"单 qubit 门的常见误解","id":"单-qubit-门的常见误解"},{"level":2,"text":"与经典门对比","id":"与经典门对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Bloch 球","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-foundations/bloch-sphere"},"next":{"title":"多 qubit 门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-and-circuits/multi-qubit-gates"}}